# Leave unset in both local dev AND production.
#
# Local dev: Vite proxies /api/* to localhost:3001 (see vite.config.js).
# Production: vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the deployed server, so the
# client and API appear same-origin to the browser — required for the
# session cookie to survive on mobile browsers, which are much stricter
# about sending cookies cross-site than desktop browsers are.
#
# Only set this if you're deploying the client WITHOUT the vercel.json
# proxy (e.g. hosting client and server as genuinely separate origins) —
# doing so re-introduces the cross-site cookie problem the proxy exists
# to avoid, so prefer keeping this unset.
# VITE_API_URL=https://your-server.onrender.com
